      <activity id="a20f01b8-9219-5b4b-917a-23a8b4e9842c" activityNameId="316f571d-9f7e-54d6-b2eb-5b03a2b70a3c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium tripolyphosphate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium tripolyphosphate, at plant
The functional unit represents spray-dried powder of sodiumtripolyphosphate (STPP). The data are based on one single company and on literature (Landbank report about phosphate in detergents established for UK conditions).;
CAS number: 007758-29-4; 
UUID: 49141f50-671f-33a9-96d2-33acbcaafa7c
This module contains material and energy input for the production of sodium tripolyphosphate out of phosphoric acid. Infrastructure has been estimated. No process emissions are accounted for.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: dihydrate process
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see geography and IncludedProcesses
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_49141f50-671f-33a9-96d2-33acbcaafa7c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
